  "title": "Ex 4.6 · a | b and a | c give a | (b + c)",
  "prompt": "Use a direct proof. Let $a, b, c$ be integers. Show that if $a \\mid b$ and $a \\mid c$, then $a \\mid (b + c)$.",
  "answer_format": "A structured proof: let, case, expr and witness steps (notes optional). No final answer box.",
